    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual jigsaw puzzle game. All you need to do is use the mouse to drag the pieces to the correct positions, and when you complete the puzzle and form a complete picture, you can unlock the picture gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Drag the fragments with the mouse and swap their positions with other fragments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Just push all the pieces into the correct positions to complete the puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 You can click the icon at the bottom right of the game to temporarily view the full image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Cute style + soothing music </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Programmatic automated cutting and assembling of puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Optional Difficulty Level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A total of 36 pictures are available for selection</p>",
